{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zVIfMfhmFY1794610642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>原油期貨價格扭轉過去兩日升勢，並連跌第二個星期。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報88.56美元一桶，跌18美仙，跌幅百分之0.2。倫敦期油收市報95.84美元一桶，升2美仙，升幅百分之0.02。</p><p></p><p>全個星期計，紐約期油及倫敦期油都跌約百分之2.5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.734608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:18:53.276309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:18.974846+00:00","content_hash":"85d9cda7b72da6ed86f28ee8a29e125fe8daeeadac42b000d92dc827d17f6efb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.734608+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}